  "query_preview": "/TUESDAY NIGHT THROUGH SUNDAY/...\nIssued at 203 PM CDT Sun Sep 20 2026\n\nThe cold air will be much welcomed after the summer we've had.\nThough, it'll take a bit for it to get here. Temperatures will\nreally start to feel cooler on Tuesday and Wednesday. Though,\nthis will be more near average for this time of year. Dewpoints\nwill finally dip into the 50s Tuesday night making the\nevenings/mornings feel nice in cool as temperatures sit in the\n50s as high pressure settles in and keeps these temperatures\naround for a few days. Daytime highs will be in the 70s and 80s\nto end the week with rain returning this weekend as the next \nfront moves through.",
